Prepare six focused cases for actual tuple admission before publication, legal fallback, transactional late import failure, ownership acknowledgements, bounded static-page recovery, and the ordinary U8 GL allocation/upload/copy/sample path. Fix the process-type scope lifetime and record actual GL API/version/renderer.

All regression sources are prepared only; no compiler, configure or tests were executed.
